{
  "dom_id": "step-e4091",
  "name": "Example: Rewriting a Logarithm Using the Change of Base Formula",
  "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $\\log x ?$ \n\nI. $\\dfrac {\\log_{2} x} {\\log_{2} 10}$\n\nII. $\\dfrac {\\log_{2} 10} {\\log_{2} x}$\n\nIII. $\\log_{2}\\left(\\dfrac{x}{10}\\right)$",
  "worked_solution": "The change of base formula for logarithms is\n\n$$\n\\log_a X = \\dfrac {\\log_b X} {\\log_b a}.\n$$\n\nThe change of base formula works with any new base. In this example, the choices are written using base $2,$ so we rewrite $\\log x$ in terms of $\\log_2.$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{log}⁡x & ={log}_{10}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{{log}_{2}⁡x}{{log}_{2}⁡10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e4091\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Rewriting a Logarithm Using the Change of Base Formula</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e4091\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n          